   'Winston-Salem is a city and the county seat of Forsyth County, North Carolina, United States. The Winston-Salem metropolitan area has an estimated 705,000 residents, making it the fourth-largest metropolitan area based in North Carolina, with the Metropolitan area "growing" to be located directly west of the "core central" Greensboro-High Point metropolitan area of North Carolina. It is the fifth-most populous city in North Carolina and 90th-most populous city in the United States, with a population of 249,545 at the 2020 census. It is the second-most-populous city in North Carolina''s Piedmont Triad region, home to about 1.7 million residents.', '["clm_wiki_winston-salem_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'places_ingest_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());

