  ('cs_panama-city_demographics', 'plc_panama-city', 'demographics', 'Demographics',
   'Climate [ edit ] Under the Köppen climate classification , Panama City has a tropical savanna climate ( Köppen Aw ), a little drier than a tropical monsoon climate . It sees 1,900&#160;mm (74.8&#160;in) of precipitation annually. The wet season spans from May through November, and the dry season spans from December through April. Temperatures remain constant throughout the year, averaging around 27&#160;°C (81&#160;°F). Sunshine is subdued in Panama because it lies in the Intertropical Convergence Zone , where there is a nearly continual cloud formation, even during the dry season. Climate data for Panama City (1991–2020) Month Jan Feb Mar Apr May Jun Jul Aug Sep Oct Nov Dec Year Mean daily maximum °C (°F) 32.2 (90.0) 32.7 (90.9) 33.2 (91.8) 33.4 (92.1) 32.4 (90.3) 31.8 (89.2) 31.8 (89.2) 31.9 (89.4) 31.4 (88.5) 31.1 (88.0) 31.1 (88.0) 31.7 (89.1) 32.1 (89.8) Daily mean °C (°F) 26.8 (80.2) 27.1 (80.8) 27.5 (81.5) 28.0 (82.4) 27.6 (81.7) 27.2 (81.0) 27.2 (81.0) 27.2 (81.0) 26.9 (80.4) 26.6 (79.9) 26.6 (79.9) 26.9 (80.4) 27.2 (81.0) Mean daily minimum °C (°F) 21.4 (70.5) 21.5 (70.7) 21.8 (71.2) 22.6 (72.7) 22.9 (73.2) 22.7 (72.9) 22.6 (72.7) 22.5 (72.5) 22.4 (72.3) 22.2 (72.0) 22.1 (71.8) 21.8 (71.2) 22.3 (72.1) Average rainfall mm (inches) 24.1 (0.95) 12.3 (0.48) 14.2 (0.56) 71.0 (2.80) 221.8 (8.73) 242.0 (9.53) 189.5 (7.46) 221.0 (8.70) 268.4 (10.57) 311.2 (12.25) 258.9 (10.19) 124.6 (4.91) 1,959 (77.13) Average rainy days (≥ 1 mm) 2.4 1.6 1.9 5.2 15.4 16.8 15.1 16.0 17.4 19.5 16.8 7.5 137.5 Average relative humidity (%) 71.2 68.4 66.8 68.2 78.4 82.1 81.6 81.9 83.4 84.7 83.5 76.8 77.3 Mean monthly sunshine hours 244.9 232.0 248.0 195.0 139.5 117.0 133.3 130.2 114.0 111.6 132.0 186.0 1,983.5 Mean daily daylight hours 11.7 11.8 12.1 12.3 12.4 12.6 12.6 12.4 12.2 11.9 11.7 11.6 12.1 Percentage possible sunshine 69 70 67 53 36 31 34 34 32 31 38 52 46 Source 1: World Meteorological Organization &#91; 1 &#93; Source 2: ETESA (sunshine data recorded at Albrook Field) &#91;', '["clm_wiki_panama-city_demographics"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'places_ingest_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
