   'Parkersburg is a city in Wood County, West Virginia, United States, and its county seat. Located at the confluence of the Ohio and Little Kanawha rivers, it is the state''s fourth-most populous city and the center of the Parkersburg–Vienna metropolitan area. The city''s population was 29,738 at the 2020 census, and its metro population was 89,490.', unixepoch(), unixepoch());

