VALUES
  ('plc_el-dorado', 'place', 'el-dorado', 'El Dorado', 'published', 'en', 0,
   'El Dorado is a mythical city of gold supposedly located somewhere in South America. The legend originated in 16th-century Spanish accounts of a ruler known as el Dorado, or the Golden One, who was said to cover himself in gold dust before washing it off in a sacred lake. Over time, the name came to refer not only to the ruler, but also to a lost city or kingdom of immense wealth.', unixepoch(), unixepoch());

